# Summary

The charter states: Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter.[[cite:obs-2941d8058471068c9e02a7954d1d3b71cf524e1c "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]

The annex specifies the amount: Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January.[[cite:obs-a64873ddd5a19f1390cecc52def052e584095087 "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]]